OL,3,GNEWSAStates schools to close due to
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates of Guernsey schools will be
OL,7,Fclosed on Friday due to predicted high
OL,8,Fwinds caused by Storm Austen, officials
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FJersey Met has issued a red wind
OL,12,Fwarning for Friday morning with force
OL,13,Fnine gusts of 75mph (120km/h) and
OL,14,Fpotentially force 10 up to 85mph.
OL,16,FThe States said there was a risk of
OL,17,Fflying debris and falling trees
OL,18,Fespecially during the peak of the storm
OL,19,Fwhen people would usually be commuting.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
