OL,3,GNEWSAStates schools to close due to
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services advised roads should
OL,7,Fbe kept as clear as possible in case
OL,8,Fthey need to respond to an incident,
OL,9,Fwhich officials said led to the
OL,10,Fdecision to close schools.
